## Rebuild and validate

```bash
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
python -m scripts.validate_catalog
python -m scripts.generate --check
python -m scripts.check_secrets
python -m pytest -q
```

Maintainers can run `python -m scripts.check_links` for an optional live URL check. A 403, 429 or timeout is not proof that an upstream resource is gone.

